/target
**/*.rs.bk
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
config/local.toml
config/verify.toml
*.log
# per-crate SBOMs are build intermediates: cargo-cyclonedx writes them next to the
# manifest and build-release.sh moves them into dist/. The SBOM of record is
# dist/z2m-guard-<version>.cdx.json, not a stale copy committed inside the crate.
crates/*/*.cdx.json
# CI file lives here until a token with the `workflow` scope is available

# release artifacts
dist/
